From 284c53b21091b281830a57b680b78276103a8749 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kob <kob@invalid>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:51:37 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Viewers come first: strict hold on work below, seeks take a
 bounded few connections, quick STATs

---
